      Dialogue Panel Active","comment":"You will under ''Canvas'' in the hierachy
      from the scene view that its greyed out. Its set to not active in the hierachy
      because we want to toggle it on only when we need a dialogue box.\n\nGet game
      active self is a node that gets its own current state, is it active or is it
      not? If it get toggled on somewhere, let it tell you its state active/inactive.","color":{"r":0.0,"g":0.0,"b":0.0,"a":1.0},"guid":"f6290e8c-cd67-41af-8bed-02bd8123fcda","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"}],"$version":"A"}}'
